<title>USA: Pacific Scientific Co Q3 net falls.</title>
<headline>Pacific Scientific Co Q3 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>NEWPORT BEACH, Calif. 1996-10-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>PACIFIC SCIENTIFIC COMPANY</p>
<p>			    (Unaudited)</p>
<p>			   QUARTER ENDED	 NINE MONTHS ENDED</p>
<p>		    Sep 27,     Sep 29,	Sep 27,	Sep 29,</p>
<p>			1996	  1995	   1996	   1995</p>
<p>Total Sales</p>
<p>		 71,193,000  70,455,000  218,698,000  212,393,000</p>
<p>COST OF SALES</p>
<p>		 49,257,000  45,507,000  149,461,000  140,227,000</p>
